            "content": "<h4><strong>Payment</strong></h4><p>You can safely pay with Klarna, credit card, or bank transfer – choose what works best for you.<br/></p><h4><strong>Shipping</strong></h4><p><br/>We offer different rates for the UK and the Rest of the World:</p><ul><li><strong>United Kingdom (UK): </strong>Standard Shipping: <strong>£2.00</strong> (Free on orders £37 and over)Priority Shipping: <strong>£4.50</strong></li><li><strong>Rest of the World:</strong>Standard Shipping: <strong>$2.95</strong> (Free on orders $49 and over)Priority Shipping: <strong>$6.00</strong></li></ul><p><strong>Delivery Time</strong><br/><br/>As our UK warehouse is temporarily out of stock, your order will be shipped from our international warehouse.<br/>We offer two shipping options at checkout:</p><ul><li><strong>Standard Shipping:</strong> 1–2 days handling + 5–10 days shipping time</li><li><strong>Priority Shipping:</strong> 1–2 days handling + 4–7 days shipping time</li></ul><p>A tracking number will be sent by email as soon as your order leaves the warehouse.</p><p><strong>Questions?</strong><br/>Email us at <strong>info@shopvetpets.com</strong> – we always reply within 24 hours on weekdays.</p>",
            "page": "",
            "margin_top": 24,
            "margin_bottom": 0
          }
        },
