    "image_with_text_ij7gr6": {
      "type": "image-with-text",
      "blocks": {
        "heading_AyRBAn": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "title": "A simple habit that <strong>makes a big difference</strong>",
            "title_highlight_color": "#47b5e9",
            "heading_size": "h2"
          }
        },
        "text_G9h3Th": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Many cat owners think dental care is too difficult or complicated. <strong>But with FreshWipes, it's so easy that you'll actually use them.</strong><br/><br/>Wiping your cat's<strong> teeth 1-2 times a week is enough to keep</strong> plaque at bay and prevent <strong>painful problems in the future.</strong><br/><br/><strong>A healthy mouth affects the whole body. </strong>With FreshWipes, your cat will not only have fresher breath and whiter teeth, but also <strong>a stronger immune system and more energy.</strong> Less pain, more play, and more closeness.</p>",
            "text_style": "body"
          }
        }
