            "muted_autoplay": true,
            "title": "Glycerin",
            "text": "<p>Glycerin moisturizes the mucous membranes and gums in your mouth, reducing the risk of irritation and providing a gentler clean.Glycerin moisturizes the mucous membranes and gums in your mouth, reducing the risk of irritation and providing a gentler clean.</p>",
            "link_label": "",
