    "testimonials_mWJtQX": {
      "type": "testimonials",
      "blocks": {
        "column_Cpjw8g": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "star_rating": 5,
            "title": "Finally something that works",
            "text": "<p>Tried powders, sprays, water additives - nothing worked. Vet quoted $2,800 for cleaning and I was terrified of anesthesia. After 3 weeks with these wipes, her teeth look cleaner and she doesn't fight me like she did with the toothbrush. Wish I'd found these sooner.</p>",
            "author": "- Sarah M., Brooklyn, NY"
          }
        },
        "column_9WNceh": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "star_rating": 5,
            "title": "She actually tolerates it",
            "text": "<p>My cat used to scratch me bloody when I tried brushing. These wipes? She just sits there. Takes 30 seconds and the wipe comes out brown so you know it's working. Vet said her gums look way better than 6 months ago.</p>",
            "author": "- Emma L., Manchester, UK"
          }
        },
        "column_iwC7Hj": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "star_rating": 5,
            "title": "Avoided expensive surgery",
            "text": "<p>Was quoted $3,200 for dental surgery. Started using these daily and after 2 months the vet said her gums improved so much we can hold off on surgery. Actually works and saved me thousands.</p>",
            "author": "- James R., Sydney, AU"
          }
        },
        "column_7nRHqn": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "star_rating": 5,
            "title": "You can see it working",
            "text": "<p>Spent $200+ on dental products that did nothing. With these you actually see the brown plaque on the wipe after using it. My cat tolerates them and her teeth are noticeably whiter after 2 weeks. Should've tried these first.</p>",
            "author": "- Rachel K., Portland, OR"
          }
        },
        "column_RQknLY": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "star_rating": 5,
            "title": "Vet complimented me",
            "text": "<p>My rescue cat had rough teeth when I adopted her. Been using FreshWipes for 6 weeks and at her checkup the vet said \"wow, her teeth look great - what are you doing?\" She's never had to go under anesthesia. So relieved.</p>",
            "author": "- Sophie T., London, UK"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
