    "collapsible_content_r8iUdD": {
      "type": "collapsible-content",
      "blocks": {
        "collapsible_row_HyppzU": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Is this 100% safe for my cat?",
            "icon": "",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "row_content": "<p>✅ <strong>Yes! FreshWipes are made to be as gentle as they are effective.</strong></p><p><br/></p><p>They are free from:</p><p>❌ Alcohol</p><p>❌ Parabens</p><p>❌ Essential oils (which can irritate cats)</p><p>❌ Harsh chemicals or artificial fragrances</p><p><br/></p><p>Our formula is developed with veterinary insight to ensure safety even for cats with sensitive gums or skin.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_RgParf": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How do I use the wipes?",
            "icon": "",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "row_content": "<p>Slip the wipe onto your finger and gently clean your cat’s teeth and gums.</p><p>Focus especially along the gum line and areas with visible plaque or discoloration.</p><p><br/></p><p>No toothbrush. No stress. No mess.</p><p>Use daily or a few times a week for best results.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_Hz6PwA": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Is this a substitute for toothbrushing?",
            "icon": "",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "row_content": "<p>For most cat owners – yes.</p><p>Brushing is great in theory, but often unrealistic in everyday life.</p><p><br/></p><p><strong>FreshWipes make dental care simple and gentle – without the struggle.</strong></p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_UQKrrB": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What’s in the formula?",
            "icon": "",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "row_content": "<p>Only what your pet needs – nothing more. Every ingredient is carefully selected to support safe and effective oral care:</p><ul><li><strong>EDI-purified water</strong> – gentle base solution</li><li><strong>Cetylpyridinium chloride monohydrate</strong> – proven antibacterial used in human oral care</li><li><strong>Allantoin</strong> – soothes and protects sensitive gums</li><li><strong>Glycerin</strong> – moisturizes gums and oral tissue</li><li><strong>Citric acid</strong> – balances pH to prevent bacterial growth</li><li><strong>Tea polyphenols</strong> – freshens breath naturally</li><li><strong>Green tea extract</strong> – natural antibacterial & protective</li></ul><p>✔️ <strong>pH-balanced & alcohol-free</strong> – safe for daily use<br/><br/>✔️ <strong>No fluoride or harsh chemicals</strong><br/><br/>✔️ <strong>Not tested on animals</strong> (cruelty-free development)</p><p><em>Just safe, simple, and effective dental care – in every wipe.</em></p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_W6njid": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "When can I expect results?",
            "icon": "",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "row_content": "<p>😽 <strong>Fresher breath in just a few days.</strong></p><p>😺 <strong>Cleaner teeth and healthier gums in 2–3 weeks with regular use.</strong></p><p><br/></p><p>Hold tight – your cat’s mouth will thank you!</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_XLG7i4": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Is FreshWipes suitable for all cats?",
            "icon": "",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "row_content": "<p>Yes! The wipes are flexible and gentle, suitable for both kittens (from 6 months) and adult cats.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_N4Nqn4": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Do the wipes help with bad breath?",
            "icon": "",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "row_content": "<p>Yes. The antibacterial ingredients and natural breath-fresheners help reduce odor and bacteria that cause bad breath.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_aUggTN": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How should I store FreshWipes??",
            "icon": "",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "row_content": "<p>Keep the container tightly closed in a cool, dry place.</p><p>Avoid direct sunlight to maintain moisture in the wipes.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_t4etaH": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What happens if I’m not satisfied?",
            "icon": "",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "row_content": "<p>We stand behind our product with a <strong>100-Day Money-Back Guarantee</strong></p><p>If you don’t see a visible difference – or if it simply doesn’t work for your pet – just reach out.<br/><br/>You’ll get a <strong>full refund</strong>, no questions asked.</p><p><strong>No stress. No hassle. Just peace of mind.</strong></p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        }
      },
